Sure, it doesn&#39;t take a lot to build him up normally, but I know personally I often have to make a difficult choice with LEgacy of building up or doing things now. With this power you can do both, or get out combos that are really hard to set up much faster. Turn 1 get out motivational charge and legacy ring. Or Fortitude and LEad from the Front, Surge of Strength and Thokk, ect. Plus, you don&#39; have to play the card yourself, or you could even patrol the environment and remove something nasty as a base power.
